  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Locally Led Support for Vulnerable Populationsin Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this award is to strengthen the resilience of Ukrainian local communities to recover from the impact of the protracted humanitarian crisis and help strengthen local networks to better respond to post-crisis challenges with a specific attention to the most vulnerable groups.</narrative>
  </description>
